WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.550
Here is the curve y equals x
squared, and a straight line,

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.210
y equals two x plus c.

3
00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:10.230
Turn c down, and the line slides.

4
00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:12.930
At first, it cuts the curve twice.

5
00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:14.750
The crossings close in.

6
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.470
For one exact position,
it just touches the curve.

7
00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:20.160
Then it misses.

8
00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:23.380
When exactly does a
line just touch a curve?

9
00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:27.150
And what single number could tell
you, before you draw a thing?

10
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.470
In this mission, you'll solve
a line and a curve together,

11
00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:33.350
by substituting one
equation into the other.

12
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.890
That leaves one quadratic equation.

13
00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:39.500
Each of its roots gives a point
where the line and curve meet.

14
00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:43.130
Your mission: find when a
line just touches a curve,

15
00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:44.930
and the one number that tells you.
